<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Tasmanian Women's International tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat Mana Endo (Japan) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
